# Intermediate output of tools/research_context/lean/ExtractDeps.lean.
# Regenerate with:
#   lake env lean tools/research_context/lean/ExtractDeps.lean > research-index/raw_decls.jsonl
# Not versioned: multi-MB, and a fresh blob on every rebuild. The derived
# research-index/formal_graph.json IS versioned, so every command except
# `build` works from a clean clone with no Lean build.
/research-index/raw_decls.jsonl
